Enable M2M Rest API Via Delta Commission
    [Arguments]  ${vdu_index}=0   ${gnb_index}=0   ${timeout}=${30}   ${webem_password}=${EMPTY}
    [Documentation]  This keyword is used to enable the M2M API interface, that means setting the value of actCli in SCF to true.
    ...
    ...  *AUTHOR* calla.wang@nokia-sbell.com
    ...
    ...    |    =Input Parameters=     | =Man.= | =Description= |
    ...    | vdu_index              | No  | vdu index in testline configuration file. Default is 0. |
    ...    | gnb_index              | No |  gnb index in testline configurtion file. Default is 0. |
    ...    | timeout | No | Timeout for the delta commission finished, default is 30s. |
    ...    | webem_password | No | default value is EMPTY will get from file init |
    ...
    ...    *RETURN VALUE*
    ...   None

    ${conn_alias}    generic_utils.get_unique_id_string
    vdu_gen.login_rest   vdu_index=${vdu_index}   gnb_index=${gnb_index}   alias=${conn_alias}   webem_password=${webem_password}
    vdu_cm_business.switching_m2m_interface_by_delta_commission   actcli_value=true
    ...                                                           conn_alias=${conn_alias}
    ...                                                           timeout=${timeout}
    [Teardown]    vdu_gen.logout_rest    conn_alias=${conn_alias}

Fast Delta Commissioning With Delta Json File
    [Arguments]  ${json_file_path}  ${use_m2m}=${True}  ${vdu_index}=0   ${gnb_index}=0   ${timeout}=${300}   ${webem_password}=${EMPTY}
    [Documentation]  This keyword is used to do delta commissioning by given a delta json file which is classical bts delta json format.
    ...              No need to create, validate and activate delta plan, only one provision or fast-activate REST API is used.
    ...  The file content is like
    ...
    ...  [
    ...        {
    ...
    ...          "distName": "MRBTS-10777/MNL-1/MNLENT-1/FEATCADM-1",
    ...
    ...          "operation": "update",
    ...
    ...          "parameters": [
    ...                            {
    ...
    ...                                "parameterName": "actCli",
    ...
    ...                                "value": "true",
    ...
    ...                                "operation": "update"
    ...
    ...                            }
    ...                        ]
    ...
    ...        }
    ...  ]
    ...
    ...  *AUTHOR* calla.wang@nokia-sbell.com
    ...
    ...    |    =Input Parameters=     | =Man.= | =Description= |
    ...    |   json_file_path        | Yes | the delta json file path. |
    ...    |   vdu_index             | No  | vdu index in testline configuration file. Default is 0. |
    ...    |   gnb_index             | No |  gnb index in testline configurtion file. Default is 0. |
    ...    | timeout | No | Timeout for the delta commission finished, default is 300s. |
    ...    | webem_password | No | default value is EMPTY will get from file init |
    ...
    ...    *RETURN VALUE*
    ...   None
    ${conn_alias}    generic_utils.get_unique_id_string
    vdu_gen.login_rest   vdu_index=${vdu_index}   gnb_index=${gnb_index}   alias=${conn_alias}   webem_password=${webem_password}
    vdu_cm_business.fast_delta_commission_with_delta_json_file   ${json_file_path}
    ...                                                           use_m2m=${use_m2m}
    ...                                                           conn_alias=${conn_alias}
    ...                                                           timeout=${timeout}
    [Teardown]    vdu_gen.logout_rest    conn_alias=${conn_alias}

Fast Delta Commission With Delta Data List
    [Arguments]  ${delta_data_list}  ${use_m2m}=${True}  ${vdu_index}=0   ${gnb_index}=0   ${timeout}=${300}
    ...   ${webem_password}=${EMPTY}
    [Documentation]  This keyword is used to do fast delta commission vDU by given a delta data list.
    ...              No need to create, validate and activate delta plan, only one provision or fast-activate REST API is used.
    ...
    ...  *AUTHOR* calla.wang@nokia-sbell.com
    ...
    ...    |    =Input Parameters=     | =Man.= | =Description= |
    ...    | delta_data_list | Yes | delta parameters that need to be modified, it can be constructed by keyword |
    ...    | use_m2m | No | Whether use M2M API, if the actCli is disabled, it should be set to False, default is True. |
    ...    | vdu_index   | No  | vdu index in testline configuration file. Default is 0. |
    ...    | gnb_index   | No |  gnb index in testline configurtion file. Default is 0. |
    ...    | timeout | No | Timeout for the delta commission finished, default is 300s. |
    ...    | webem_password | No | default value is EMPTY will get from file init |
    ...
    ...   - *delta_data_list:* Each element of the argument is also a list. The structure for each element is
    ...
    ...     ``[<str mo_name>, <dict param_name: parma_value>, <str operation_type (create, delete, update)>]``
    ...
    ...     An Example of delta data list:
    ...
    ...     [['mo1_name', {'param1/0/sub_param_1':'value1_1', 'param2':'value2'}, 'update'],
    ...
    ...        ['mo2_name', {'param1/0/sub_param_1':'value1_1', 'param2':'value2'}, 'create']]
    ...
    ...     It can be formatted by keyword -
    ...
    ...     ``taf.rfrl.cbts.utilities.generic_generic_utils.construct_delta_data_for_delta_commissioning``
    ...
    ...      Using '-' to seprated complex parameters, like ``param1-0-sub2=v1``
    ...
    ...      See `Execute Delta Commission Step By Step` for how to construct the delta data list.
    ...
    ...    *RETURN VALUE*  None
    ...
    ${conn_alias}=    generic_utils.get_unique_id_string
    vdu_gen.login_rest   vdu_index=${vdu_index}   gnb_index=${gnb_index}   alias=${conn_alias}   webem_password=${webem_password}
    ${org_delta_data_list}=    vdu_cm_business.fast_delta_commission_by_delta_data
    ...  delta_data_list=${delta_data_list}
    ...  use_m2m=${use_m2m}
    ...  conn_alias=${conn_alias}
    ...  timeout=${timeout}
    [Return]  ${org_delta_data_list}
    [Teardown]    vdu_gen.logout_rest    conn_alias=${conn_alias}


Execute Delta Commission Step By Step
    [Arguments]  ${delta_data_list}  ${delta_plan_file_name}=DELTA-PLAN-1
    ...          ${force_reset}=${True}   ${auto_lock_cells}=${True}
    ...          ${vdu_index}=0   ${gnb_index}=0
    ...          ${timeout}=${300}
    ...          ${webem_password}=${EMPTY}
    [Documentation]  This keyword is used to do delta commissioning step by step by given a delta data list for vDU.
    ...              That means the delta commission will follow the next procedure:
    ...              generating delta plan file, updating parameters, validating and activating delta plan.
    ...
    ...  *AUTHOR* calla.wang@nokia-sbell.com
    ...
    ...    |    =Input Parameters=     | =Man.= | =Description= |
    ...    | delta_data_list | Yes | delta parameters that need to be modified. |
    ...    | delta_plan_file_name | No | delta plan name, the default value is DELTA-PLAN-1 |
    ...    | force_reset | No | The force reset option, default is true. |
    ...    | auto_lock_cells | No | The auto lock cells option, default is true. |
    ...    | vdu_index   | No  | vdu index in testline configuration file. Default is 0. |
    ...    | gnb_index   | No |  gnb index in testline configurtion file. Default is 0. |
    ...    | timeout | No | Timeout for delta plan activation finished, default is 300. |
    ...    | webem_password | No | default value is EMPTY will get from file init |
    ...
    ...   - *delta_data_list:* Each element of the argument is also a list. The structure for each element is
    ...
    ...      ``[<str mo_dn>, <dict {param_name: parma_value}>, <str operation_type (add,remove,replace,revert)>]``
    ...
    ...       It can be formatted by keyword
    ...
    ...      ``taf.rfrl.cbts.utilities.generic_generic_utils.construct_delta_data_for_delta_commissioning``
    ...
    ...      Using '-' to seprated complex parameters, like ``param1-0-sub2=v1``
    ...
    ...    *RETURN VALUE*
    ...
    ...   Only the original values of those parameters which operation type is '*replace*' are returned.
    ...   It can be used to restore the parameters in case teardown if all of the operation types are 'replace'.
    ...   The data structure is the same as the argument `delta_data_list`.
    ...
    ...   *Example:*
    ...   | Library | taf/rfrl/cbts/utilities/generic_generic_utils.py |  |
    ...   | ${delta_data_list_1}= | generic_generic_utils.construct_delta_data_for_delta_commissioning  |  |
    ...   | ... |  mo_dn=MRBTS-123 |  |
    ...   | ...  | operation_type=replace |  |
    ...   |  ... |  param1-0-sub1=v1 |  param2=v2  |
    ...   | ${delta_data_list_2}= | generic_generic_utils.construct_delta_data_for_delta_commissioning  |  |
    ...   | ... |  mo_dn=MRBTS-123/NRBTS-123 |  |
    ...   | ...  | operation_type=add |  |
    ...   |  ...  |  param1-0-sub1=v1 |  param2=v2  |
    ...   | ${all_delta_data_list}= | create list | ${delta_data_list_1} |
    ...   | ... | ${delta_data_list_2} |  |
    ...   | ${org_delta_data_list}= |  Execute Delta Commission Step By Step  |  ${all_delta_data_list}  |
    ...
    ...   Construct delta data list using ``create list`` and ``create dictionary``
    ...
    ...   | ${param_dict_1}= |   create dictionary  |   param1/0/sub_param=value1 |   param2=value2 |  |
    ...   | ${one_mo_list_1}= |  create list |  mo1 | ${param_dict}  | replace |
    ...   | ${param_dict_2}= |   create dictionary |   param1=value1 |   param2=value2|   |
    ...   | ${one_mo_list_2}= |  create list |   mo2 | ${param_dict}  | create  |
    ...   | ${all_delta_data_list}= |   create list | ${one_mo_list_1}  | ${one_mo_list_2}   |   |
    ...   | ${org_delta_data_list}= | Execute Delta Commissioning Step By Step | ${all_delta_data_list}  |  |   |
    ...
    ...  *Note:*
    ...
    ...  If using keyword ``generic_generic_utils.construct_delta_data_for_delta_commissioning`` to construct the delta data list,
    ...  complex parameters like ``periodicCsiAcquisition/0/csiReportPeriodicity`` under ``MRBTS-x/NRBTS-x/NRCELL-x`` should be given like
    ...  ``periodicCsiAcquisition-0-csiReportPeriodicity=value``
    ...
    ${conn_alias}=    generic_utils.get_unique_id_string
    vdu_gen.login_rest   vdu_index=${vdu_index}   gnb_index=${gnb_index}   alias=${conn_alias}   webem_password=${webem_password}
    ${org_delta_data_list}=    vdu_cm_business.delta_commission_step_by_step
    ...  delta_data_list=${delta_data_list}
    ...  delta_plan_name=${delta_plan_file_name}
    ...  force_reset=${force_reset}
    ...  auto_lock_cells=${auto_lock_cells}
    ...  conn_alias=${conn_alias}
    ...  timeout=${timeout}
    [Return]  ${org_delta_data_list}
    [Teardown]    vdu_gen.logout_rest    conn_alias=${conn_alias}


